      "value": "<p><strong>Required Number of Abilities 5</strong></p><p><strong>Granted Abilities</strong> @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.ZHSzNt3NxkXbj1mI]{flier}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.cT5octWchU4gjrhP]{manual dexterity}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.v7zE3tKQb9G6PaYU]{partner in crime}, @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.familiar-abilities.Item.zyMRLQnFCQVpltiR]{speech}</p><hr><p>Tooth fairies are difficult to work with, as they love mischief more than most fey, and the mischief they love usually involves taking teeth. A tooth fairy familiar expects plenty of opportunities to take teeth, so a life of frequent conflict and combat is perfect for these temperamental fey.</p><hr><p>@UUID[Compendium.pf2e-specific-familiars.sf2e-specific-familiars-actions.Item.lspuIMmlsKB5rdQ1]{Tooth Tug}</p><p>@Embed[Compendium.pf2e-specific-familiars.sf2e-specific-familiars-actions.Item.lspuIMmlsKB5rdQ1 inline]</p>",
